1
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:07,400
I cannot believe that you didn't tell me we are still married!
你居然沒告訴我 我們還是夫妻

2
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:09,370
Look,I was going to tell you.
我有打算告訴你

3
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:12,100
When? After the birth of our first secret child?
什麼時候？ 第一個小孩偷偷出生後？

4
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:16,640
Ross didn't get the annulment. We are still married!
羅斯沒辦註銷，我們還是夫妻

5
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:18,900
-You're kidding. -Oh,my God!
什麼？ 我的天哪

6
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:26,220
It wasn't my best decision,but I couldn't face another failed marriage.
或許這個決定不好 但我無法面對另一次失敗婚姻

8
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:30,190
At what point did you think this was a successful marriage?
我插個嘴 你覺得這段婚姻哪裡成功？

9
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:37,290
Rach,come on. If you think about it, it's actually kind of funny.
別這樣，其實想想還蠻好笑的

10
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:41,800
Maybe it's best not to think about it.
還是不要想好了

11
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:47,100
This is inexcusable. I'm shocked to my very core.
這真是不可原諒 我真是震驚到了極點

12
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:51,010
Phoebe,I told her you already knew.
菲比，我已經說你知道了

13
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:56,810
Another lie. You have a sickness!
又在騙人，你真的有病

14
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:02,690
For my own peace of mind, are you married to any more of us?
羅斯，你沒娶我們其他人吧？

15
00:01:04,590 --> 00:01:06,860
Look,Rach,I was going to tell you.
我有打算要告訴你 

16
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:09,590
I just wanted to do it in my own way.
我只是想用我的方式說

17
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:12,670
Yes,silently,with no words.
是啊，無聲勝有聲的方式

18
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:21,730
Look,in Ross' defense,okay....
我要替羅斯說句話…

19
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:31,550
The One With Joey's Porsche
本集播出：「名車狂想曲」

00:01:32,650 --> 00:01:33,550
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

20
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:07,680
Someone left their keys.
有人掉了鑰匙…

21
00:02:08,090 --> 00:02:10,680
To a Porsche.
是保時捷

22
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:14,260
-Are these yours? -Yeah. That's what I drive.
阿甘，這是你的嗎？ 是啊，我開保時捷

23
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:19,320
I make 4 bucks an hour. I saved up for 350 years.
我時薪4塊錢，存了350年

24
00:02:22,041 --> 00:02:23,565
少來了

25
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:27,070
Did anybody lose their keys?
有人掉了鑰匙嗎？

26
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:29,010
Put them in the lost and found.
你可以放進失物招領箱

27
00:02:29,180 --> 00:02:30,940
There's a lost and found?
這裡有失物招領箱？

28
00:02:32,180 --> 00:02:33,910
My shoe!
我的鞋子

29
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:37,080
You left a shoe here?
你掉了一隻鞋在這裡？

30
00:02:37,250 --> 00:02:42,020
I didn't realize till I got home. I wasn't gonna walk back with one shoe.
我回到家才發現 我才不要光著一隻腳再回來

32
00:02:42,790 --> 00:02:46,490
I'll go find that guy's car and leave a note on the windshield.
我要去找那輛車，然後留言

33
00:02:46,660 --> 00:02:50,030
When he comes back for his keys, I'll give him your shoe.
等他來了我會把你的鞋子給他

34
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:51,190
Great. Thanks.
太好了，謝謝

35
00:02:53,670 --> 00:02:56,360
Oh,good. You guys are here. Listen.
太好了，你們在這裡

36
00:02:56,540 --> 00:03:00,870
How would you like to spend tomorrow taking care of three cute puppies?
明天要不要一起照顧 三隻超可愛的小狗？

37
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:03,310
My God! What a fun day! Sounds great!
好棒喔，聽起來好好玩 

38
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,140
Yeah,all right.
好吧

39
00:03:05,450 --> 00:03:07,780
I'll bring them by tomorrow morning.
好，我明早帶他們過來

40
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:11,220
By the way,they're not actually puppies.
對了，其實不是小狗 

41
00:03:11,390 --> 00:03:14,080
They're Frank and Alice's triplets. See you.
是法蘭克的三胞胎，好，再見

42
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,550
What?
什麼？

43
00:03:16,820 --> 00:03:19,820
Please,please,please? Frank and Alice...
拜託拜託拜託…

44
00:03:19,990 --> 00:03:23,520
asked me to baby-sit them. I'm nervous. I've never done that.
他們托我帶小孩，我好緊張 我沒有一個人帶過小孩

45
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:25,360
Don't worry. We'll do it.
放心，我們一定會幫忙

46
00:03:25,530 --> 00:03:29,490
I'm gonna pass,because I was kind of iffy when it was puppies.
我就不了 是狗狗時我就很猶豫了

47
00:03:30,740 --> 00:03:34,400
Come on,Chandler. It'll give us great practice for when...
好啦，這是練習的好機會…

48
00:03:34,580 --> 00:03:36,840
people with babies come to visit.
總會有客人帶小孩來

49
00:03:39,452 --> 00:03:41,511
不是那輛

50
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:49,620
So I still have boxes here.
這裡還有我的東西 

51
00:03:50,090 --> 00:03:52,530
I still have boxes at Ross'.
羅斯家也有我的東西

52
00:03:52,690 --> 00:03:54,660
And I have nowhere to live.
而我卻沒地方住 

53
00:03:54,830 --> 00:03:57,390
I could so easily freak out right now.
我現在應該要捉狂才對

54
00:03:58,370 --> 00:04:03,200
What about me? Denise is leaving town for a while. I don't have a roommate.
那我呢？我剛發現 狄妮絲要出遠門，我沒室友了

55
00:04:06,210 --> 00:04:10,110
Well,maybe I could be your roommate,Phoebe.
也許我可以當你的室友 

56
00:04:11,310 --> 00:04:13,610
Maybe you could be my roommate!
也對

57
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:16,780
Well,there's an idea!
有辦法了 沒錯

58
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:18,280
That would be great!
太好了！

59
00:04:18,450 --> 00:04:22,720
-How long is Denise gone for? -She said she'd be back December 26th.
狄妮絲要去多久？ 她說她12月26日回來

61
00:04:22,890 --> 00:04:24,620
December 26th.
12月26日 

62
00:04:24,790 --> 00:04:26,090
Maybe she's Santa Claus.
也許她是聖誕老公公

63
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:37,160
Oh,look who it is. My husband,the apple of my eye.
看，是我老公，我的心肝寶貝

64
00:04:37,810 --> 00:04:40,870
Okay,I got us a court date for tomorrow at 2...
我已經約好明天2點出庭 

65
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:43,410
and I picked up all the forms.
表格也都拿了

66
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:44,980
I'll take care of it.
我會搞定

67
00:04:45,150 --> 00:04:49,810
Sure,if you say you'll take care of it,I have no reason to doubt you.
當然，既然你說你會搞定 我當然沒理由懷疑你

68
00:04:50,050 --> 00:04:51,810
Give me those forms.
拿來啦

69
00:04:51,990 --> 00:04:55,820
I'm gonna do this my way and I don't wanna hear a peep out of you.
我要照我的方式去做 你不准嘰嘰歪歪

70
00:04:55,990 --> 00:04:58,480
-Okay, Rach,but.. -You're peeping!
好，但是… 你在嘰嘰歪歪喔

71
00:05:03,230 --> 00:05:04,790
Ross,I just got..
你知道嗎？我實在是… 

72
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:07,430
-Why did you do this? -I told you..
你為什麼要這樣？ 我說過… 

73
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,330
I don't wanna hear "three failed marriages."
我不想聽三次失敗的婚姻

74
00:05:10,510 --> 00:05:13,300
If you'd had two failed marriages, you'd understand.
如果你失敗過兩次就會瞭解了

75
00:05:13,470 --> 00:05:15,700
Thanks to you, I'm halfway there.
多虧你，我現在只差一次

76
00:05:19,180 --> 00:05:23,620
Oh,I am so mad,Ross! I don't think I've ever been this angry!
我快氣死了 我從來沒有這麼氣過

77
00:05:25,090 --> 00:05:27,350
What about when I said we were on a break?
我說我們分手了那次呢？

78
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:54,980
-Nice car. -Yeah,it's not mine.
好車 不是我的

79
00:05:56,920 --> 00:06:00,220
-I love your car. -Yeah,it's mine.
我喜歡你的車 它是…我的

80
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:05,150
-I bet it's fast. -Me too. Yeah.
一定很能跑 我想也是

81
00:06:05,330 --> 00:06:07,420
And comfortable.
而且很舒服

82
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,500
-You like leather seats? -Yeah.
你喜歡皮椅嗎？ 喜歡

83
00:06:12,270 --> 00:06:14,230
It's got them!
它有皮椅

84
00:06:18,610 --> 00:06:20,040
Phoebe,how's it going?
菲比，你那邊怎樣？ 

85
00:06:20,210 --> 00:06:23,340
I'm okay. Are they having fun? Am I talking too fast?
還好，蠻不錯的 你覺得他們開心嗎？ 我講話太快了嗎？

86
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:24,880
No. You sound like me.
不會，跟我差不多

87
00:06:25,550 --> 00:06:29,350
It's going great. Look at Chandler with Little Baby Girl Chandler.
一切都很好 你看錢德和小女生錢德

88
00:06:29,950 --> 00:06:34,480
Little Baby Girl Chandler. Where have I heard that before? Oh,Coach Rubin.
小女生錢德，我在哪裡聽過？ 對了，魯本教練

90
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:44,890
Phoebe,when you're done over there, we've got a situation over here too.
菲比，等你那邊忙完 我們這裡也有狀況

91
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:48,860
No. We are all responsible for our own babies.
不行，自己的小孩自己顧

92
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:52,440
That's where you're wrong. We've been playing them man-to-man.
那你就錯了 我們一直採取人盯人戰術

94
00:06:52,610 --> 00:06:55,240
We should really be playing a zone defense.
但我們應該打區域聯防

95
00:06:55,910 --> 00:06:57,540
What do you mean?
什麼意思？ 

96
00:06:57,710 --> 00:07:02,010
Things'll go smoother if we each have a zone. Phoebe,be in charge of wiping.
我覺得一人守一區會比較順暢 菲比，你可以負責擦屁屁

98
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:05,110
Mon,be in charge of diapering.
摩妮卡，你負責包尿布

99
00:07:05,290 --> 00:07:09,750
I'll be in charge of looking at how cute they are when they put their hands...
我就負責看他們捉著我的手…

100
00:07:11,490 --> 00:07:14,290
Sounds great, but you should be in charge of wiping.
好主意，也許你才應該擦屁屁

101
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:17,400
Okay,I'm a rookie. I should not be in the end zone.
我是菜鳥，不該守球門區

102
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:32,450
This is so great. This is exactly how we set the plates at the restaurant.
真好，餐廳都這樣準備餐點的

103
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:35,450
Yeah? Well, this is not what I ordered.
是嗎？我可不是點這個

104
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:41,050
Hey,guys.
大家好

105
00:07:41,220 --> 00:07:42,210
Hey,babies.
寶寶們好

106
00:07:43,990 --> 00:07:45,420
I'm having the best morning.
早上真過癮

107
00:07:45,590 --> 00:07:48,150
That Porsche I've got the keys to? Still there.
那輛保時捷還在

108
00:07:48,330 --> 00:07:51,860
Shocking, since you still have the keys.
不會吧，畢竟鑰匙在你手上

109
00:07:52,970 --> 00:07:55,990
You should see the treatment I get with that car.
你應該看看大家對我的態度

110
00:07:56,170 --> 00:07:59,700
People are friendly. They wanna talk. And not just about the car.
每個人都很友善，找我聊天 而且不只是聊車子 

111
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:02,040
One guy advised me on my equity investments.
還有人教我投資策略

112
00:08:02,210 --> 00:08:03,340
What equity investments?
什麼投資？

113
00:08:03,510 --> 00:08:06,640
The ones that got me the Porsche. Will you keep up?
賺到保時捷的股票投資 你跟上好嗎？

114
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:15,180
If people see me just standing there, they're gonna think I don't own it.
但要是我光杵在那裡 別人會覺得那不是我的車

115
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:18,850
So I figure I'll wash it. Monica, you got a bucket and soap?
所以我要洗車 摩妮卡，你有水桶和肥皂嗎？

116
00:08:19,030 --> 00:08:22,290
Oh,yeah. I got soap and sponges and rags...
有，我有肥皂、海綿、抹布 

117
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:26,420
and carnauba wax and polishing compound.
亮光臘和打臘工具組

118
00:08:26,970 --> 00:08:28,490
You don't even have a car.
你根本沒有車

119
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:33,330
I know. Once there was a dirty car in front of the building,so I washed it.
對，但樓下停過一輛很髒的車 我就把它給洗了

120
00:08:34,540 --> 00:08:37,240
-And? -And six others.
還有呢？ 還有另外六輛 

121
00:08:37,410 --> 00:08:38,570
There you are.
這就對了

122
00:08:42,250 --> 00:08:44,810
Yeah,she tops out at 130.
它可以飆到130

123
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:49,120
That's just in the city. I get her up to 160 upstate.
這還是市內 到了郊外可以軋到160

124
00:08:49,290 --> 00:08:51,760
Really? You got a place upstate?
是嗎？你在郊外有房子？ 

125
00:08:52,090 --> 00:08:53,530
Sure.
當然

126
00:08:55,230 --> 00:08:58,130
-All right. See you later. -Okay. Take it easy.
改天見 好，慢走

127
00:08:59,730 --> 00:09:02,500
Hey. That's my car.
喂？那是我的車

128
00:09:03,070 --> 00:09:04,440
Really?
是嗎？

129
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,700
Just give me five more minutes.
再給我5分鐘

130
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,740
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

131
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:13,110
I found the keys and now I'm just polishing her up.
我檢到鑰匙，現在在幫它打臘

132
00:09:13,780 --> 00:09:16,840
-But it's my car. -Yeah,but it's my wax.
但這是我的車 這是我的臘

133
00:09:18,290 --> 00:09:21,080
Listen,I don't come to the city much.
聽著，我很少進市區

134
00:09:21,260 --> 00:09:24,950
I don't know if you're crazy or if this is some street theater...
我不知道你是瘋子 還是在演街頭劇

135
00:09:25,130 --> 00:09:27,560
but could I have my keys?
但請把鑰匙還給我 

136
00:09:27,730 --> 00:09:30,890
Sure. Yeah. I'll save your parking spot.
拿去 我幫你佔車位 

137
00:09:31,100 --> 00:09:32,760
I'm not coming back.
我不回來了

138
00:09:32,930 --> 00:09:34,900
-Why not? -I live upstate.
為什麼？ 我住在郊外

139
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:37,030
Yeah,so did I.
是啊，我本來也是

140
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:41,530
I don't know why I was so nervous...
我之前不曉得在緊張什麼

141
00:09:41,710 --> 00:09:44,770
and why Frank and Alice complain. This is easy.
法蘭克他們為什麼會抱怨 帶孩子太容易了

142
00:09:44,950 --> 00:09:47,810
Yeah, two hours, a lifetime, that's the same.
是啊，2小時和一輩子一樣

143
00:09:49,620 --> 00:09:52,420
Check it out! When the babies wake up...
你們看 寶寶醒來後

144
00:09:52,590 --> 00:09:54,490
they can meet Krog!
可以認識克洛格

145
00:09:56,890 --> 00:09:59,330
That thing could put someone's eye out.
你在幹什麼？那個東西會害人

146
00:09:59,490 --> 00:10:02,830
He can do more than that. He can destroy the universe.
不只，他還能毀滅宇宙

147
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:06,390
They could swallow one of those little parts.
不，寶寶可能會誤食那些零件

148
00:10:06,570 --> 00:10:10,330
Also,look at his smooth area. That's just gonna mess them up.
而且那個光滑的部位 會誤導他們

149
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:15,430
It's just not an appropriate toy for 1-year-olds. Or 30-year-olds.
這種玩具不適合1歲的寶寶 和30歲的男人

150
00:10:15,610 --> 00:10:18,510
They won't swallow anything. You're too overprotective.
他們才不會誤食什麼 你們這叫保護過度

151
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:22,480
When I was a kid,my mom used to throw me into a pile of broken glass.
我小時候 我媽都把我扔在碎玻璃堆裡

152
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:26,680
-What? -Glass, sand, whatever.
什麼？ 玻璃，沙子，還不都一樣嘛

153
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:31,220
Look at little Leslie stretching in her sleep.
小萊絲莉邊睡邊伸懶腰 

154
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:32,720
Oh,it's so cute.
好可愛喔

155
00:10:32,890 --> 00:10:35,920
I wonder when you stop putting both legs behind your head.
不知道要到幾歲 才沒辦法把腿舉到頭上

156
00:10:36,100 --> 00:10:37,330
I can still do that.
我現在還是可以

157
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:41,430
How are you still single?
你怎麼會還沒結婚？

158
00:10:43,270 --> 00:10:47,970
I thought about it and maybe you're right. Maybe Krog is not a safe toy.
好吧，我想或許你們說得對 或許克洛格不夠安全

159
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:52,040
-What made you change your mind? -I swallowed his sonic blaster gun.
你為什麼改口了？ 我吞了音波死光槍

160
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,780
How did that happen?
怎麼會這樣？

161
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:57,310
I was trying to prove that I was right.
我想證明我是對的 

162
00:10:57,890 --> 00:10:59,940
And it turns out I was wrong...
結果我錯了

163
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:02,320
and now it's lodged in my throat.
現在它卡在我的喉嚨裡

164
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:09,700
This whole time we were concentrating on the babies...
真是的，我們光顧著帶小孩 

165
00:11:09,860 --> 00:11:12,560
and no one was watching Chandler!
都忘了要看著錢德

166
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:18,090
You are asking the court for an annulment?
兩位要申請註銷婚姻？

167
00:11:18,270 --> 00:11:21,210
Yes, Your Honor. Here are our forms, all filled out.
是的，申請表都填好了

168
00:11:21,380 --> 00:11:23,610
So based on your petition...
根據申請書所言

169
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:26,470
you are seeking an annulment on the grounds...
你申請註銷的理由是 

170
00:11:26,650 --> 00:11:29,410
that "Mr. Geller is mentally unstable."
蓋勒先生的精神狀況不穩定

171
00:11:32,490 --> 00:11:35,220
Fine. I'm mentally unstable.
好，我精神狀況不穩定

172
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:39,590
And based on the fact that "Mr. Geller is an intravenous drug user."
而且他使用靜脈注射毒品

173
00:11:40,730 --> 00:11:44,060
-What? -Yes. Heroin and crack.
什麼？ 是的，海洛因與快克

174
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,490
Crack isn't even an intravenous drug.
快克根本不是靜脈注射毒品 

175
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:50,230
Well,you would know.
你當然瞭解了

176
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:54,630
Now, it also says here that you...
這上面還說...

177
00:11:54,810 --> 00:11:57,740
"lied about your sexual preference before marriage."
你在婚前隱瞞性向

178
00:11:57,910 --> 00:11:58,900
Oh,come on.
拜託 

179
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:01,510
Ross,please. I found the magazines.
羅斯，我發現那些雜誌了

180
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:06,910
And finally,that you were "unable to consummate the marriage."
還有你無法履行夫妻間的義務

181
00:12:07,090 --> 00:12:10,920
Well, that makes sense since you're gay and addicted to heroin.
這也難怪，你是同志 又上癮海洛因

182
00:12:12,460 --> 00:12:14,990
You know, I'm sorry, this is insane.
很抱歉，這太誇張了

183
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:19,030
I'm not addicted to heroin, I'm not gay and there is no problem...
我沒有上癮海洛因 我不是同志

184
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,930
with my ability to consummate anything.
我履行什麼都沒問題

185
00:12:22,100 --> 00:12:25,270
I'll consummate this marriage right here, right now!
我現在就可以在這裡履行

186
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:28,810
That won't be necessary.
沒有這個必要

187
00:12:29,210 --> 00:12:32,580
And when we were dating, we consummated like bunnies.
我們交往時簡直跟兔子有得拼

188
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:37,850
If you were involved in a serious relationship, that creates a problem.
如果你們曾經認真交往 那就有問題了

189
00:12:38,020 --> 00:12:41,390
Rest assured, that relationship ended two years ago.
大人，我們2年前就分手了

190
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:44,720
Strike "consummated like bunnies" from the record.
可以刪掉「跟兔子有得拼」嗎

191
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:48,860
Is there anything in this record that is actually true?
這份申請書有任何實言嗎？

192
00:12:49,030 --> 00:12:52,190
Well, yes. We got married in Vegas.
有，我們確實在賭城結婚 

193
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:55,300
And the names,I think.
名字應該也沒錯

194
00:12:55,540 --> 00:12:57,730
That's not the way the legal system works.
這樣不符合法律程序

195
00:12:57,910 --> 00:13:02,600
This process is based on an objective review of the facts, not of the lies.
申請註銷得根據客觀事實 而不是謊言

196
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:04,770
Objection!
抗議

197
00:13:05,350 --> 00:13:07,440
-It doesn't work like that either. -Overruled.
這樣也不合程序 駁回 

198
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:09,780
Oh,stop it.
別鬧了

199
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:14,350
Based on what I've heard, you certainly don't qualify for an annulment.
從剛才的話聽來 兩位不符合註銷資格

200
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:17,490
If you don't wanna be together, file for divorce.
如果你們不想在一起 就必須辦理離婚

201
00:13:17,990 --> 00:13:22,360
That's great. You happy? Look what you did with your funny, funny form.
太好了，你高興了嗎？ 都是你的搞笑表格害的

202
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:27,000
What? Me? What about you and your "consummated like bunnies" nonsense?
我？你那句跟兔子有得拼呢？

203
00:13:28,300 --> 00:13:32,760
What are you typing that for? She said we don't get the annulment.
那…你打什麼打？ 你聽到沒？我們不能辦註銷了

205
00:13:32,940 --> 00:13:34,910
Don't type that. What..
不要打

206
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,770
Stop typing!
別再打了

207
00:13:37,710 --> 00:13:39,200
Stop typing!
別再打了

208
00:13:39,750 --> 00:13:42,380
"Stop typing, stop typing!"
別打了！別打了

209
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:46,350
Okay, do you see what you're keeping me married to?
你看你讓我嫁的是什麼人？

210
00:13:47,190 --> 00:13:48,880
Get out of my chambers.
請兩位離開我的辦公室

211
00:13:49,060 --> 00:13:50,550
Lady, here's the deal.
好，你給我聽著

212
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:54,820
I came here for an annulment and I'm not leaving here until I get one!
我是來辦註銷的 沒辦成我絕對不走

213
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:58,450
-Would you like a night in jail? -Thank you for your time.
你們想在牢裡過夜嗎？ 耽誤您了

214
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:23,520
That Porsche guy took his car back.
保時捷的主人把車開走了

215
00:14:26,530 --> 00:14:29,460
But you found the keys to his clothes?
但你檢到他的衣櫥鑰匙？

216
00:14:30,730 --> 00:14:35,260
No, I just love the way it feels when everybody thinks I own a Porsche.
不是，我只是喜歡 大家以為我有保時捷的感覺

217
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,930
They'll think you own one because of the clothes?
你穿這樣別人就會以為你有？ 

218
00:14:38,110 --> 00:14:39,800
Of course.
那當然

219
00:14:40,210 --> 00:14:43,800
Only an idiot would wear this stuff if he didn't have the car.
白癡才會沒車還穿成這樣

220
00:14:46,750 --> 00:14:48,740
That is true.
那倒是

221
00:14:49,950 --> 00:14:53,180
Yeah,but only a genius would swallow a sonic blaster gun.
不過只有天才 才會誤食音波死光槍

222
00:14:53,350 --> 00:14:55,320
Oh,I've been there.
我也誤食過

223
00:14:57,490 --> 00:15:00,720
I am gonna go drive my Porsche.
我要去開我的保時捷了

224
00:15:01,060 --> 00:15:03,360
You know you don't actually have one.
喬伊，你知道你沒有保時捷吧

225
00:15:03,530 --> 00:15:07,520
What are you doing? I'm in character. Will you talk to her?
拜託，你搞什麼？ 我正在入戲，你說說她，好嗎

226
00:15:09,270 --> 00:15:11,570
I think it just moved. It's poking me.
它動了，現在真的好刺

227
00:15:11,740 --> 00:15:13,600
We'll go to the emergency room.
夠了，我們去掛急診

228
00:15:13,770 --> 00:15:17,300
No, you can't leave me here with them. We're babysitting.
什麼？你們不能把我扔給他們 我們正在帶孩子

229
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:20,470
The babies are asleep. You'll be okay on your own.
寶寶都睡了 你撐一下一定沒問題

230
00:15:20,650 --> 00:15:23,080
You can't leave me with them. We're a team.
但你們不能把我扔給他們 我們是一隊的

231
00:15:23,250 --> 00:15:25,620
We're playing a zone. They'll triple-team me!
在打區域聯防 他們會以三打一

232
00:15:26,990 --> 00:15:30,450
He's got plastic in his throat. We gotta go to the hospital.
他的喉嚨卡了個塑膠玩具 我們非去醫院不可

233
00:15:30,690 --> 00:15:34,650
But a doctor won't be able to help him. And it's just gonna...
但醫生也幫不了他 

234
00:15:34,830 --> 00:15:38,030
naturally pass through his system in seven years.
反正過個7年就會自動排出

235
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:42,270
-I think that's gum. -I'm pretty sure it's gun.
那是口香糖 我確定是死光槍

236
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,870
This really hurts. Let's go.
真的很痛，我們走吧

237
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:49,530
But no! A real man wouldn't just run to the hospital.
男子漢才不會衝去醫院

238
00:15:50,210 --> 00:15:52,770
No! What would Krog do?
克洛格會怎麼做？

239
00:15:54,780 --> 00:15:58,980
Why isn't that valet back with my Porsche?
泊車小弟怎麼還沒 把我的保時捷開來？

240
00:16:00,490 --> 00:16:02,480
Maybe because you've got the keys?
因為鑰匙在你手上嗎？

241
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:05,824
保時捷

242
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:11,800
-That was totally your fault. -My fault? You threatened the judge.
都是你的錯 我的錯？你威脅法官

244
00:16:11,970 --> 00:16:14,940
You ripped the paper out of the court reporter's machine!
你把書記員的打字紙撕下來

245
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:18,470
That was the only way I could get him to stop typing!
那樣才能阻止他打下去

246
00:16:19,210 --> 00:16:21,270
Hi. How are the Gellers?
蓋勒夫婦好嗎？

247
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:28,250
Don't call us that.
不准那樣叫我們

248
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:33,010
The judge wouldn't let us get an annulment. Now we gotta get a divorce!
法官不准我們辦註銷 我們得去辦離婚

249
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:35,950
Did a Porsche throw up on you?
你被保捷附身了嗎？

250
00:16:40,730 --> 00:16:42,660
It's "Porsche-a"!
是保時捷

251
00:16:43,830 --> 00:16:46,600
Me taking care of you is no problem, huh?
我完全可以照顧你們對吧？

252
00:16:46,770 --> 00:16:49,500
You guys feel safe, right?
你們覺得很安心吧？

253
00:16:49,670 --> 00:16:52,830
I'm gonna take that spit bubble as a "Yeah,I do!"
吐泡泡就表示「安心」

254
00:16:53,340 --> 00:16:57,640
Let's get rid of this dirty diaper. I'll set you up with a clean one.
我扔了髒尿布 就幫你換一塊乾淨的

255
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:02,010
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to scare you. I just have to clean that up.
抱歉，我不是故意的 我得先清理一下

256
00:17:02,180 --> 00:17:04,950
Because, let's face it, we're at Monica's.
這是摩妮卡的家

257
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:11,220
I broke it. All right. Well, that's just the way things go.
破了，反正東西遲早都會壞

258
00:17:11,390 --> 00:17:13,690
Okay. Good.
好，就這樣

259
00:17:15,130 --> 00:17:17,030
Why are there only two of you?
為什麼只剩兩個？

260
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,690
Where's Leslie?
萊絲莉呢？

261
00:17:18,870 --> 00:17:22,630
Well, you can't answer. Leslie? Where are you, Leslie?
你們不會說話 萊絲莉？你在哪裡？

262
00:17:22,870 --> 00:17:25,900
Now would be a good time for your first words.
萊絲莉 現在是開口說話的好時機

263
00:17:28,540 --> 00:17:29,980
Well, look at you!
你看看你

264
00:17:31,580 --> 00:17:35,640
You are a little bit mischievous. My gosh!
你有點皮喔，真是的

265
00:17:36,220 --> 00:17:38,650
Oh, you're a lot mischievous.
是非常皮

266
00:17:40,550 --> 00:17:42,490
Well, it'll dry.
反正會幹

267
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:45,960
You sit with your brother and sister now...
去跟哥哥妹妹躺在一起… 

268
00:17:46,130 --> 00:17:47,890
who aren't there.
他們不在

269
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:03,200
How do you feel?
你還好嗎？

270
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:07,110
Let's just say Krog will be equipped to destroy the universe again...
克洛格就又能毀滅宇宙了

271
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:09,270
in 12 to 14 hours.
再過12到14小時 

272
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:13,740
I totally took care of the babies all by myself.
我一個人把孩子都帶好了 

273
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,890
I fed them,bathed them and put them to bed.
餵奶、洗澡、哄他們睡覺

274
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:18,750
And protected them from a tornado?
還保護他們躲過龍捲風？

275
00:18:22,700 --> 00:18:23,750
Oh,my God!
我的天哪 

276
00:18:23,930 --> 00:18:26,460
I know. The babies are asleep.
對啊，寶寶都睡了

277
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:29,200
Phoebe, what happened here?
菲比，家裡是怎麼了？

278
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:32,360
I did it. I took care of the babies all by myself.
我做到了，我一個人照顧寶寶

279
00:18:32,540 --> 00:18:36,640
-But my apartment! -Was the setting of Phoebe's triumph.
但是我的房子 是菲比勝利的戰場

280
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:39,340
But the mess!
但是這一團亂 

281
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:43,380
Is not as important as the fact that Phoebe took care of the babies.
比起菲比的辛勞實在不算什麼

282
00:18:44,650 --> 00:18:47,310
You're right. I shouldn't freak out.
你說得對，我不該大驚小怪

283
00:18:47,490 --> 00:18:50,890
This is what it'll be like when we have babies. When's that?
等我們有了孩子也會這樣 那是什麼時候呢？

284
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:56,120
Phoebe, look at this mess!
菲比，你看你弄得多亂

285
00:19:04,370 --> 00:19:07,670
Oh,honey. Thank God you're home. I was getting worried.
親愛的，你總算回來了 我都開始擔心了

286
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:11,510
I picked up the divorce papers.
我去領了離婚證書

287
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:16,950
I've already signed everything. I put little X's where you need to sign.
該簽的我都簽了 你要簽的地方我也畫了叉

288
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:19,920
Little X's. Great! That makes up for everything.
畫叉，真好 這樣就前嫌盡釋了

289
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:25,690
You know, you've done a lot of stupid stuff too, okay?
我…你也幹過很多蠢事好嗎

290
00:19:25,890 --> 00:19:28,730
Name one stupid thing that is as stupid as this one.
有哪一件跟這次一樣蠢

291
00:19:28,900 --> 00:19:31,520
How about you flew to London to stop my wedding?
你飛去倫敦阻止我結婚怎麼說

292
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:34,460
You told me you loved me after I was married.
我已經結婚了，你還說你愛我

293
00:19:34,670 --> 00:19:39,300
Wait,that was different. I did those things because I was in love with you.
慢著，那不一樣 我做那些事是因為我愛你

294
00:19:39,470 --> 00:19:40,960
Right.
正是

295
00:19:44,340 --> 00:19:47,400
You're right. That's very different.
你說得對，的確很不一樣 

296
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:50,020
So let's just sign the papers.
總之趕快簽一簽吧

297
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:53,640
What?
怎樣？ 

298
00:19:53,820 --> 00:19:55,120
Nothing.
沒事

299
00:19:56,120 --> 00:19:58,520
Okay, can we just sign, please?
請簽名

300
00:20:10,540 --> 00:20:12,440
Congratulations.
恭喜你

301
00:20:12,610 --> 00:20:14,700
Okay, wait,Ross. Wait a minute.
羅斯，等一下

302
00:20:16,310 --> 00:20:19,040
I kind of have a little confession.
我有件事要坦白 

303
00:20:19,210 --> 00:20:20,650
What?
什麼事？

304
00:20:20,810 --> 00:20:23,510
Well, you know, this whole marriage thing.
結婚這件事

305
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,580
Kind of my idea.
算是我的主意

306
00:20:26,620 --> 00:20:28,280
Excuse me?
什麼？ 

307
00:20:28,460 --> 00:20:33,090
Remember how we were too drunk to remember anything when we were married?
當時我們不是醉到什麼都想不起來

308
00:20:33,165 --> 00:20:33,997
Yeah？
怎樣？

309
00:20:34,900 --> 00:20:39,920
I didn't really wanna say anything, but it just kept coming back to me.
我很不想說 但是我的記憶一直回來

310
00:20:40,630 --> 00:20:45,330
We were in the casino and you thought it'd be funny to eat a lot of grapes.
記不記得我們在賭場 你突然覺得狂吃葡萄會很好玩

311
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:51,010
And I thought it would be funnier if we got married.
然後我覺得我們結婚會更好玩

312
00:20:51,180 --> 00:20:55,640
So as a compromise we decided first to get married and then...
於是我們折衷，先去結婚 

313
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:59,270
to eat a lot of grapes.
再去吃很多葡萄

315
00:21:03,490 --> 00:21:06,760
Sorry I got us into this whole thing.
抱歉惹出這些麻煩

316
00:21:07,460 --> 00:21:09,860
So then if you think about it...
所以仔細想想 

317
00:21:10,030 --> 00:21:13,020
this is all your fault.
這一切都是你的錯

318
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:16,630
Yeah, don't push it, though.
不要得寸進尺

319
00:21:19,670 --> 00:21:21,230
I gotta say...
我知道...

320
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:24,370
I know I divorce a lot of women.
我跟很多人離過婚

321
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:30,550
Never thought I'd be divorcing you.
卻從來沒想過會跟你離婚

322
00:21:30,950 --> 00:21:32,280
I know.
是啊

323
00:21:32,620 --> 00:21:36,450
I always thought if we got married, that'd be the one that stuck.
我總覺得要是我們結婚 一定會天長地久

324
00:21:37,190 --> 00:21:39,620
And it wouldn't be a secret...
不會是秘密結婚 

325
00:21:39,990 --> 00:21:43,330
and we wouldn't have our wedding dinner at Pizza Hut.
也不會在必勝客吃酒席

326
00:21:45,500 --> 00:21:47,300
Did I even treat?
我有請客嗎？

327
00:21:47,470 --> 00:21:51,270
No, it was on the house. It was a newlywed special.
沒有，那是免費的 新婚夫婦特惠

328
00:21:51,870 --> 00:21:54,670
That may be the most depressing thing I've heard.
我沒聽過這麼令人沮喪的事

329
00:21:57,910 --> 00:22:00,440
I should get these to my lawyer's office.
我去律師那裡送件

330
00:22:01,420 --> 00:22:03,610
Thanks for taking care of all this.
謝謝你把事情都辦妥 

331
